  "answer": "The current CEO of Maersk is **Vincent Clerc**, who has held the position since **January 1, 2023**.\n\n**Source:** [Maersk Executive Leadership Team - Vincent Clerc](https://www.maersk.com/about/executive-leadership-team/vincent-clerc)\n\n***\n\n**Methodology:**\nTo ensure professional corporate intelligence standards, the following cross-referencing process was employed:\n1. **Primary Identification:** The official Maersk Executive Leadership Team page was accessed to identify the current CEO and the effective start date of their tenure.\n2. **Secondary Verification:** The official Maersk Investor Relations (IR) portal was searched for regulatory announcements regarding leadership transitions to ensure the data was not based solely on a biography page.\n3. **Temporal Distinction:** The \"Change of CEO\" press release was analyzed to explicitly distinguish between the appointment announcement date (December 12, 2022) and the effective start date (January 1, 2023).\n4. **Current Status Validation:** The IR leadership listings and recent corporate filings were reviewed to confirm that no further changes have occurred since the January 2023 transition.\n\n**leadership_data** (memo: Vincent Clerc, January 1, 2023, https://www.maersk.com/about/executive-leadership-team/vincent-clerc)\n\n**verification_report** (memo: Verified, May 22, 2024, https://investor.maersk.com/news-releases/news-release-details/change-ceo)",
